<title>USA: CMS Energy Corp sells $350 mln in debt.</title>
<headline>CMS Energy Corp sells $350 mln in debt.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following debt issue from CMS Energy Corp, a Michigan electric and gas utility, was priced on Thursday, according to lead manager Morgan Stanley.</p>
<p>The issue was increased in size from $300 million.</p>
<p>BORROWER: CMS ENERGY CORP</p>
<p>AMT $350 MLN	 COUPON 8.125 PCT  MATURITY 5/01/2002</p>
<p>TYPE SNR NOTES     ISS PRICE 99.785  FIRST PAY DATE 11/01/97</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S Ba3   YIELD 8.177 PCT   PAY FREQ SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P BB	  SPREAD 162.5 BP   CALLABLE NO</p>
<p>((--U.S. Corporate Bond Unit, 212-859-1672))</p>
</text>
